              You can email Izzy Plante, our Co-Founder and CEO, anytime at <a href="mailto:izzy@sage.is"><u>izzy@sage.is</u></a>. They rely on their personal <strong>Sage AI (Mini Izzy)</strong> for organization, so expect a direct, thoughtful response from them.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-co-3">
