              <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
            <div id="faq-sec-3" class="faq-answer" hidden>
              <p>Data customers enter into Sage is stored in multiple, redundant data centers or securely on site when customers choose to use our own site solution. That data is backed up several times a day, and copies of those backups are stored both locally and off-site to further reduce points of possible failure. Files customers upload are stored off-site and backed up to servers in a different geographic region.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-sec-4">
